OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with a band of rain
OL,6,Fmoving eastwards across the region,
OL,7,Fthis could fall as sleet for a time
OL,8,Fover high ground. Winds will increase,
OL,9,Fbecoming breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost;y cloudy at first with
OL,12,Frain clearing westwards overnight,
OL,13,Fbreaks in the cloud develop mainly in
OL,14,Fthe east allowing frost to form.
OL,15,FFeeling cold.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy in the west and
OL,18,Fclear skies in the east, for much of
OL,19,Fthe day before turning cloudy by the
OL,20,Fevening. Winds become light but breezy
OL,21,Falong the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
