OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMainly cloudy and dry on Thursday.
OL,7,FFriday and Saturday turn increasingly
OL,8,Fwetter and unsettled with snow
OL,9,Fpossible over high ground. Feeling
OL,10,Fchilly away from the coast, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
